{"id":942,"profile":{"ID":988,"title":"Jeremie Lasnier","content":"","attr_title":"","menu_type":"profile","url":"\/profile\/jeremie-lasnier\/","slug":"jeremie-lasnier","parent":"997","coords":"","offset":"","confirmation_status":"","event_length_seconds":"","point_of_contact":"","guest_type":"","event_type":"","appearance_type":"","notes":"","classes":[""],"post":{"ID":942,"post_author":"1","post_date":"2021-09-11 23:55:33","post_date_gmt":"2021-09-11 23:55:33","post_content":"\u003C!-- wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAfter completing his Master\\'s degree in Media Design at HEAD in Geneva and being a researcher in Interaction Design at ENSAD in Paris; J\u00e9r\u00e9mie Lasnier co-founded LiveLike to build immersive sports streaming experiences in VR, mobile, and web, endorsed both by the NFL and TechCrunch. As Chief Creative Officer, He pushed the boundaries of innovation by overseeing all aspects of the design from implementing interfaces, 3D environments to mixed reality augmentations. He worked with major TV channels such as Fox Sports, France TV, and SKY to broadcast the biggest events of the world like the World Cup, the Superbowl, and the final of the Champion\\'s League.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003C!-- \/wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\n\u003C!-- wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cbr\u003EJ\u00e9r\u00e9mie won multiple international awards such as a Samsung Design Award, VR Award, and a Gold Award at the Oculus Mobile VR Jam. He also joined the prestigious 30 under 30 Forbes List class of 2017.\u003Cbr\u003EIn 2020, LiveLike\\'s VR product got acquired by Cosm, a global company focused on design, technology, and innovation to deliver the best immersive experiences to partners around the world. J\u00e9r\u00e9mie joined the leadership team as VP, Immersive Design.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003C!-- \/wp:paragraph --\u003E","post_title":"Jeremie Lasnier","post_excerpt":"","post_status":"publish","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","post_password":"","post_nam